    premise: `This course covers the organisational and professional skills needed to thrive in a sales workplace. It does NOT teach selling skills (covered in other courses). It covers how to navigate the internal environment: your manager, peers, communication, time management, and remote work. These skills are relevant regardless of which sales role the learner holds.`,
