    premise: `This course covers the philosophical and methodological layer of selling — the "why and how" underneath discovery and demos. SPIN Questioning, insight selling, value-based selling, champion strategy, and multi-threading are the frameworks. This course does NOT repeat prospecting or closing — it builds the consultative mindset that underpins all of them.`,
