            explanation: `Option B is the SPIN-correct sequence. It moves from Problem ("where does it produce errors") to Implication ("what happens operationally") to Implication (quantified cost — "what does inaccuracy cost Cascade monthly"). This sequence builds urgency by connecting the problem to its downstream business consequences. Option A is three situation questions — minimal value. Option C mixes SPIN elements out of order. Option D abandons discovery entirely after one question.`
