            type: `insight`,
            content: `The question "what would make this platform a must-keep investment from your perspective?" is one of the most powerful questions in account management. It invites the customer to define the value threshold in their own words — which gives you a clear target for the relationship, and which they will then hold as a bar that's already in their mind. When they say it, they own it.`
