    premise: `This course is a dedicated, deep-dive on negotiation theory and practice — separate from the tactical negotiation covered in AE Closing (c3m5). This covers negotiation psychology, commercial frameworks, procurement dynamics, multi-party negotiations, and high-stakes deal structure. Students should have completed AE or Consultative Selling before this course.`,
