              `The high-ticket service model components: dedicated named CSM and AM (not pooled or shared), executive sponsor from the vendor (matched to the buyer's seniority), defined SLAs including escalation protocols and named contacts at each level, quarterly executive business reviews (not just operational check-ins), and a proactive success plan with named milestones and executive reporting.`
